{meta title='An order, start to finish', about='A flowchart in Mermaid-style lines - a stadium, decisions, a database and dashed loops back, ranked and routed on the server.'}
{diagram title='Handling an order'}
  A([Order placed]) --> B{In stock?}
  B -->|no| C[Order from supplier]
  C -.->|delivered| B
  B -->|yes| D[Take payment] --> E{Paid?}
  E -->|no| F[Send a reminder]
  F -.-> D
  E -->|yes| G[(Orders database)] --> H((Shipped))
{/diagram}
